### Save workflow (Nest owns auth)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{"workflowId":"wf-1","machineId":"m-1","version":2}

### Run step (Python owns execution)
POST http://localhost:8000/internal/steps/run
Content-Type: application/json

{"workflowId":"wf-1","stepId":"step-a"}